<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3341999035"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1871124033"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="AVALONIAN"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之"/><amll:meta key="album" value="AVALONIAN"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:14.502"><div begin="00:09.047" end="02:08.135"><p begin="00:09.047" end="00:12.309" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">In my dreams I catch your eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我的梦中 我映入你的眼帘</span></p><p begin="00:12.788" end="00:16.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">And it's strange to see me this shy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看见我害羞的样子 真是奇怪不已</span></p><p begin="00:16.068" end="00:19.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I strum my guitar beside the sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在海边拨弄着吉他琴弦</span></p><p begin="00:19.904" end="00:23.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">And pray for your light to guide me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的兄弟用谎言引导着我</span></p><p begin="00:23.991" end="00:27.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Couldn't betray you if I tried<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法背叛你的意志 但从前却尝试过</span></p><p begin="00:27.832" end="00:31.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Dreamt that I stayed here by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使身陷囹圄 我陪伴在你的身边</span></p><p begin="00:31.669" end="00:35.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Now when I see the setting sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今当我看见夕阳西沉</span></p><p begin="00:35.470" end="00:39.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Picture you there in Avalon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想象着你守候在我身旁 从来不会逃离</span></p><p begin="00:41.609" end="00:44.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">In this garden of disgrace<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早已名誉扫地 沦为众矢之的</span></p><p begin="00:45.460" end="00:48.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">I can still remember the taste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那种滋味 我依然记忆犹新</span></p><p begin="00:48.759" end="00:50.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">They called me the lion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说我不足为信 可如今我疲惫不堪</span></p><p begin="00:50.716" end="00:52.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">How I roared<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾如何咆哮</span></p><p begin="00:52.560" end="00:56.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">So many have died by this sword<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多少次我曾设想</span></p><p begin="00:56.588" end="01:00.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Couldn't betray you if I tried<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法背叛你的意志 但从前却尝试过</span></p><p begin="01:00.467" end="01:04.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Dreamt that I stayed here by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使身陷囹圄 我陪伴在你的身边</span></p><p begin="01:04.305" end="01:08.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Now when I see the setting sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今当我看见夕阳西沉</span></p><p begin="01:08.102" end="01:11.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Picture you there in Avalon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想象着你守候在我身旁 从来不会逃离</span></p><p begin="01:12.552" end="01:15.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I'll die defending your glory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将会誓死捍卫你的荣光</span></p><p begin="01:16.349" end="01:19.724" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Your chivalry's not a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你因为害怕而颤抖的样子并非冠冕堂皇的借口</span></p><p begin="01:20.167" end="01:23.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I'll die defending your glory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将会誓死捍卫你的荣光</span></p><p begin="01:24.018" end="01:27.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Your chivalry's not a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你因为害怕而颤抖的样子并非冠冕堂皇的借口</span></p><p begin="01:36.879" end="01:40.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Couldn't betray you if I tried<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法背叛你的意志 但从前却尝试过</span></p><p begin="01:40.757" end="01:44.591" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Dreamt that I stayed here by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使身陷囹圄 我陪伴在你的身边</span></p><p begin="01:44.601" end="01:48.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Now when I see the setting sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今当我看见夕阳西沉</span></p><p begin="01:48.461" end="01:52.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">Picture you there in Avalon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想象着你守候在我身旁 从来不会逃离</span></p><p begin="01:52.842" end="01:56.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I'll die defending your glory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将会誓死捍卫你的荣光</span></p><p begin="01:56.674" end="02:00.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Your chivalry's not a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你因为害怕而颤抖的样子并非冠冕堂皇的借口</span></p><p begin="02:00.511" end="02:03.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'll die defending your glory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将会誓死捍卫你的荣光</span></p><p begin="02:04.385" end="02:08.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Your chivalry's not a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你因为害怕而颤抖的样子并非冠冕堂皇的借口</span></p></div></body></tt>